# .gitignore for the PUBLIC agent-shell-context-bench repo.
# (The public repo is a verbatim copy of this benchmark/ directory, so this
#  file ships with it and governs it standalone.)

# --- Secrets: never commit ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
service-account*.json
*-api-key*
*token*.json

# --- Raw trial data ---
# Agent transcripts can contain absolute machine paths, usernames, and
# environment fingerprints. RAW data is NOT auto-committed. Only data that
# has passed a redaction review is added deliberately and explicitly
# (force-added past this rule), never by a blanket `git add`.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/README.md
# Pre-registration subtree: the README documenting data hygiene policy
# IS tracked (so readers see the rule). Raw smoke-trial JSONs under it
# stay gitignored.
!data/pre-registration/
data/pre-registration/*
!data/pre-registration/README.md

# --- IRR / classification working files ---
# Coder outputs may embed transcript excerpts; same redaction rule.
analysis/_scratch/
*-coder-raw.*

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Editor / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Local scratch dirs (e.g. tmp_codex_smoke/) ---
# Any directory at the repo root prefixed with `tmp_` is presumed scratch
# and excluded. Use `data/pre-registration/` for any artifact that needs
# to ship with the repo.
tmp_*/
